. The moment you sign up for Carbon, everything is included and you do not need to worry. You'll get a free carbonmade.com domain you choose when launching your site.\u003C/div\u003E","type":"text"}}},"accordion_c2rpsf8g1":{"title":"\u003Cspan\u003EI already have a domain, can I use it?\u003C/span\u003E","content":{"accordion-content_ayofo3d0r":{"html":"\u003Cdiv\u003EYes, if you already have your own domain name, you can connect it with your brand new Carbon portfolio with just a few simple clicks and be good to go in a few seconds.\u003C/div\u003E","type":"text"}}},"accordion_bbrzsdjmo":{"title":"\u003Cspan\u003EDo you have a trial for me to try?\u003C/span\u003E","content":{"accordion-content_0u0xtj5bc":{"html":"\u003Cdiv\u003EYes. You can register for free and try everything out and we won't charge you for it. You can even start a PRO trial and try out some of our PRO features before upgrading and going live.\u003C/div\u003E","type":"text"}}},"accordion_g64jweuvu":{"title":"\u003Cspan\u003EIs Carbon responsive friendly?\u003C/span\u003E","content":{"accordion-content_08n0hhm7c":{"html":"\u003Cdiv\u003EEverything you do with Carbon will automatically work on your smartphone, tablets and anywhere else. Rumors say it even works on a car dashboard.\u003C/div\u003E","type":"text"}}},"accordion_n69tpjm3j":{"title":"\u003Cspan\u003EWhat are dynamic blocks?\u003C/span\u003E","content":{"accordion-content_1xoauq4ad":{"html":"\u003Cdiv\u003EBlocks are like mini-themes but not as limiting as a theme. Think of them like Lego pieces you can use to build and re-arrange in thousands of combinations.\u003C/div\u003E","type":"text"}}},"accordion_jytf8fa79":{"title":"\u003Cspan\u003EDo you offer customer support?\u003C/span\u003E","content":{"accordion-content_pew3v8op3":{"html":"\u003Cdiv\u003EWe're always here to help if you need someone to talk or just want to share your dog pictures with someone. Please do send them.\u003C/div\u003E","type":"text"}}}},"order":["accordion_defa